          "docs": "Approve pending schedules in a date range, reporting skipped conflicts.\n\nSuccessor of /approve-recommendations: conflicted schedules (e.g. inside\nan approved Blocked window) are skipped and returned with user-readable\nconflict details instead of being silently approved."
        },
