          },
          "docs": "Approve all recommended and pending manual schedules for a warehouse within a date range.\n\nDeprecated in favor of /bulk-approve, which also reports skipped\nconflicts. This endpoint keeps its original response shape (approved\nlist only) but no longer approves schedules that conflict with an\napproved Blocked schedule — those are silently skipped."
